35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The post-occupancy reviews show high ratings where any department could book the space.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Booking data shows specialist rooms are idle, but general rooms are always full.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Tender records show mechanical plant costs rising by about a fifth recently.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,No renewal reserve was opened for the audiovisual kit bought in the last round.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Technicians spend hours on manual checks because the current equipment is inadequate.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, does the booking data support a general-purpose space?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, general rooms are turned away all year, while specialist ones sit empty.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, that missing reserve is a silent cost. It hurts our future budgets.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, exactly. The paper figures never account for the long-term decay.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mizuki, if we build more, who maintains it? The current staff are overburdened.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,So a space that is widely bookable seems to perform better in reviews.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,That aligns with the booking data. We need high utilization to justify the cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,Site diaries show six weeks lost to weather on exposed work last year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"Surveys in older blocks found hazardous material, adding months to previous projects.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The staffing freeze means we cannot hire more people to handle new upkeep.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
